title: Campaign
subtitle: Win over delegations in one region of the galaxy.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_campaign.svg
view-if: campaign_timer <= 0
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; campaign_timer = 3; last_card_timer = "campaign"
new-page: true

= Campaign

Senators answer to their home worlds, and home worlds can be persuaded. Where should the Caucus spend its effort?

- @core: The Core Worlds.
- @colonies: The Colonies and Inner Rim.
- @midrim: The Mid Rim and Expansion Region.
- @outer: The Outer Rim Territories.
- @corporate: The corporate holdings.
- @shoestring: Campaign on a shoestring.
- @easy_discard

@core
subtitle: −1 political capital. More support in the Core.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; Q.core_rc += 4 * SW.unity(Q); Q.inst_dissent -= 2; !}

The Caucus's message of clean government plays well in the Core's great cities.

@colonies
subtitle: −1 political capital. More support in the Colonies.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; Q.colonies_rc += 4 * SW.unity(Q); Q.hawk_dissent -= 2; !}

In the prosperous Colonies, the Caucus promises security and honest government.

@midrim
subtitle: −1 political capital. More support in the Mid Rim.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; Q.midrim_rc += 4 * SW.unity(Q); Q.midrim_sep -= 1; !}

The Mid Rim feels squeezed between the Core and the frontier. The Caucus listens.

@outer
subtitle: −1 political capital. More support in the Outer Rim; calms separatism a little.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; Q.outer_rc += 4 * SW.unity(Q); Q.outer_sep -= 1.5; Q.rimward_dissent -= 3; Q.inst_dissent += 1; !}

Caucus senators tour the Outer Rim. For many worlds it is the first time a Core senator has visited in living memory.

@corporate
subtitle: −2 political capital. Hard ground for the Caucus.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 2; Q.corporate_rc += 3 * SW.unity(Q); Q.guild_relation += 2; Q.rimward_dissent += 3; !}

Even on guild-owned worlds, workers and small traders are tired of being owned.

@shoestring
subtitle: Free. A small boost in a random region.
on-arrival: {! var r = SW.REGIONS[Math.floor(Math.random() * SW.REGIONS.length)]; Q[r + '_rc'] += 1.2 * SW.unity(Q); Q.shoestring_region = SW.REGION_NAMES[r]; !}

Volunteers and borrowed shuttles carry the Caucus's message to the [+ shoestring_region +].
